<Layout title="Terms" description="Simple terms for using Study Timer Online." canonicalPath="/terms">
  <section class="page-band">
    <div class="container-page legal-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">terms</p>
      <h1>Terms.</h1>
      <p>Study Timer Online provides browser-based timing tools for planning, studying, presenting, and focusing. Use the tools responsibly and verify critical timing needs in your own environment.</p>
      <h2>No warranty</h2>
      <p>The site is provided as-is. Browser behavior, device sleep settings, permissions, and operating system constraints can affect alarms, notifications, fullscreen mode, and audio.</p>
      <h2>No emergency use</h2>
      <p>Do not rely on this site for safety-critical, medical, legal, or emergency timing.</p>
      <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
      <p>Do not misuse the website, attempt to disrupt it, or present it as your own service without permission.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>